              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungu asema, “Mataifa jirani na Waisraeli ambayo yalikuwa yanawaudhi hayataweza tena kuwaumiza Waisraeli kama vile kwa miiba na michongoma. Ndipo watakapojua ya kuwa mimi ni Bwana Mwenyezi-Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.24"
            ]
          }
        }
